                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs text-purple-950 font-medium">
                Jefry (TypeSafe JEV) beroperasi dalam mode bayangan (Shadow Mode). Zero otoritas untuk menerbitkan, mengubah, membatalkan, atau merilis artikel secara otonom.
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-purple-800 bg-white/80 p-2 rounded-lg border border-purple-200">
                Saran Keputusan: Hanya memberikan rekomendasi struktural (continue, revise, human_review, stop) untuk operator manusia.
              </div>
            </div>
          ` : ''}

          ${agentId === 'lokamedia_worker_primary' ? `
            <div class="bg-orange-50 p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-orange-200 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase text-orange-900">KEBIJAKAN WORKER MEDIA</span>
                <span class="text-[9px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-orange-200 text-orange-950 border border-orange-300">
                  WORKER DISABLED
                </span>
